+- Epic 6 (CLI & TUI) -- `axiathon query` command consumes the query engine API
+- Epic 13 (WebUI) -- Story 13.5 (Query Builder & Results) uses the query engine for web-based search
+- Epic 4 (Alert Management) -- alert investigation requires query capability
