+
+**Out of scope:**
+- Full parser implementation (all operators, edge cases, error recovery) -- Story 5.2
+- Semantic analysis execution (alias resolution, type checking) -- Story 5.2
+- AST optimization (redundancy elimination, impossible conditions) -- Story 5.2
+- Query execution (AST -> DataFusion LogicalPlan -> results) -- Story 5.3
